    {
      "example": "dhg-872yt76ann7e****",
      "help_en": "Dedicated cluster ID. You can find this ID in the ApsaraDB for MyBase console under Clusters.\n\nIf you leave this parameter empty, the system returns all dedicated hosts in the specified region.\n\nIf you specify a dedicated cluster ID, the system returns all dedicated hosts in that cluster within the specified region",
      "help_zh": "专属集群ID。您可通过云数据库专属集群控制台集群列表查看目标专属集群ID。\n\n该参数为空时，默认返回该地域内所有主机信息。\n若传入具体的专属集群ID，则返回该地域该集群内所有主机信息。\n\n\n ",
      "location": "query",
